\par\par \b \uc2 HKMA Says Recent Strength In HK$ Due To Fund Inflows  \b0\par\par\uc2 286 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Oktober 2003\par 13:06\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Friday that it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar market and would continue to do so when appropriate.  \par \par \uc2 Confirming that it had bought US$100 million late afternoon when the U.S. dollar fell to around HK$7.7197, a spokeswoman at the HKMA said the government was committed to maintaining \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stability under the linked exchange rate.  \par \par \uc2 "We will inject liquidity as and when appropriate in order to dampen market volatility," she said. "We have no intention or plan to introduce any changes to the system, which is the linked exchange rate system."  \par \par \uc2 She said market sentiment toward Hong Kong has recently improved, resulting in an inflow of funds that has led to a stronger Hong Kong dollar.  \par \par \uc2 "(The peg) is the linchpin of Hong Kong's monetary and financial stability and an important factor in \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 's economic success," she said.  \par \par \uc2 Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  came a day after it sold HK$773 million. It was its fourth \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in two weeks aimed at stemming the upward pressure on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The spot rate rebounded slightly after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and was quoted at around HK$7.7195 at 0850 GMT.  \par \par \uc2 The one-year Hong Kong dollar forward was quoted at a discount of around 240 to 230 basis points to the spot rate late Friday, compared with a discount of 140 to 130 late Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 -By Julie Wang, Dow Jones Newswires; 852-2802-7002; julie.wang@dowjones.com and Nisha Gopalan, Dow Jones Newswires; 852-2802-7002; nisha.gopalan@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by John Viljoen  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020031003dza3000g9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
