\par\par \b \uc2  China's Yuan Down On Dollar-Buying By Importers \b0\par\par\uc2 237 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 August 2002\par 05:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI -(Dow Jones)- China's yuan weakened slightly against the U.S. dollar Friday on trade-related dollar buying by importers, traders said. \par \par \uc2  At 0300 GMT (11:00 p.m. EDT Thursday), the dollar stood at 8.2767 yuan versus CNY8.2766 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The dollar traded between CNY8.2766 and CNY8.2767, a very narrow range even by the yuan's standard. \par \par \uc2  "Dollar-buying from importers slightly outpaced selling from exporters and most deals were conducted at CNY8.2767," said a trader at a foreign bank in Shanghai. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps a tight watch on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and controls the flow of capital across the borders. Only partial convertibility of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the capital account is permitted. \par \par \uc2  Looking forward, traders said China's healthy trade surplus would fundamentally result in exporters' dollar selling and put downward pressure on the dollar, but without any \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy changes expected the rate is likely to remain largely unchanged. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps the rate in a tight range, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market when necessary. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar was higher at CNY1.0608 from CNY1.0607 Thursday, while the Japanese yen fell to CNY6.8852 per 100 yen from CNY6.9532. \par \par \uc2  The euro edged down to CNY8.0061 from CNY8.0885 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -By China Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; (86-21) 6218-3268; djnews.shanghai@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020823dy8n0010a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
