\par\par \b \uc2  Argentina troubles worry HK dollar, but not much. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Andrea Ricci \par \uc2 794 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Dezember 2001\par 07:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  HONG KONG, Dec 21 (Reuters) - The Hong Kong dollar, the world's second-most talked about pegged \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , came under renewed pressure on Friday after Argentina's political regime collapsed under the weight of its economic problems. \par \par \uc2  One-year Hong Kong dollar forwards rose to 300 pips from 240 late on Thursday. The rate had been at 175 on Wednesday, before the onset of the worst riots in Argentina's history marked the beginning of the end for the country's government. \par \par \uc2  A rise in forward rates indicates pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Like Hong Kong, Argentina links its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the U.S. dollar through a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board system. Its troubles invariably spark \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  jitters in Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2  Argentina's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg is widely expected to be on the way out following the abrupt departure of Economy Minister Domingo Cavallo on Thursday and the subsequent resignation of the country's president Fernando de la Rua. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say the Hong Kong dollar is still rock solid, but that doesn't mean it's irrational for traders to be cautious. \par \par \uc2  "I'm absolutely certain that (Hong Kong's) peg will stay," said Pieter van der Schaft, associate director, economic research, at Barclays Capital in Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2  "But there are some in the market that for precautionary reasons have established short positions. And that's mainly due to the small but residual risk that the peg could be abandoned." \par \par \uc2  HECK NO, THE PEG WON'T GO! \par \par \uc2  Hong Kong has no intention of letting that happen, though. \par \par \uc2  Financial officials have made it abundantly clear over and over again that snapping the peg would cause the territory more pain than gain. \par \par \uc2  The downsides from the peg are clear. \par \par \uc2  For one thing, it renders the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  unable to conduct monetary policy independent of the U.S. Federal Reserve. \par \par \uc2  Because the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  can only move in a narrow band, any adjustments in the economy must be made through prices rather than \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements. In recent years, Hong Kong has suffered from nagging deflation and falling asset prices, at least partly due to its relatively strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The benefits are equally clear. \par \par \uc2  Foreign investors in this most open of economies do not need to worry about exchange rate risk. The government, as well as most economists, agree that breaking the peg could cause massive capital outflows. \par \par \uc2  BUT WHAT ABOUT THE SPECULATORS? \par \par \uc2  It's all well and good if the authorities want to keep the peg, but what if speculators take aim at the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ? \par \par \uc2  They did once before, and were beaten badly. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  authorities in August 1998 \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the stock market to foil what they called a double edged attack on Hong Kong, whereby speculators put pressure on the peg in an attempt to drive up interest rates and push down stock prices, allowing them to take profits on short share positions. \par \par \uc2  That was at the height of the Asia crisis, and there have been no serious attacks on the peg since that time. \par \par \uc2  There's little in the Argentina crisis that would embolden speculators to go after Hong Kong's peg. Aside from their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  boards, highly indebted Argentina and virtually debt-free Hong Kong have little in common. \par \par \uc2  Hong Kong Financial Secretary Anthony Leung said investors know this. \par \par \uc2  "International investors and banks understand that Argentina and Hong Kong have great differences. Even though we both have a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board system, our economic fundamentals are vastly different," Leung said in a dinner speech on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  But Leung also said Argentina's fate should sound a warning to Hong Kong to maintain its strong financial system and take decisive steps to deal with its budget deficit, which has widened due to the economic slowdown. \par \par \uc2  Economists polled by Reuters on average expect Hong Kong's economy to contract 0.2 percent this year before rebounding by about two percent in 2002. \par \par \uc2  YEN ALSO A TROUBLEMAKER \par \par \uc2  Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said trading activity was light and moves exaggerated ahead of the Christmas holidays. \par \par \uc2  They also said the weaker yen was as much to blame for the fluctuations in rates as the Argentina situation. \par \par \uc2  The yen fell to a three-year low of 129.49 per U.S. dollar on Friday after a member of Japan's finance ministry said the yen's weakness was merely a correction of its excessive strength. \par \par \uc2  The yen has come under severe pressure recently on growing evidence of Japan's economic malaise. \par \par \uc2  "People who want to short Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  because of the weak yen will go to the Hong Kong dollar market," Barclay's van der Schaft pointed out. "It's more liquid than the others." \par \par \uc2  (with additional reporting by Christina Lo). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011221dxcl0093x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
