\par\par \b \uc2  HKMA says recouped 60 pct of Aug '98  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 314 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 August 2000\par 11:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Aug 3 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chief Executive Joseph Yam said on Thursday the government has recouped more than 60 percent of the controversial HK$118 billion it poured into Hong Kong equity markets in August 1998. \par \par \uc2  "As of yesterday, we have recouped HK$72.5 billion of the HK$118 billion we invested, and we still have about HK$175 billion in hand at market value - all for the good of the people of Hong Kong," Yam said in his weekly Viewpoint posted on the de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's website. \par \par \uc2  The government acquired most of its blue-chip equity portfolio during a controversial two-week stock market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar against \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators in August 1998. \par \par \uc2  It sold HK$33.3 billion worth of shares through the issue of Tracker Fund units in an initial public offering last November, and has a "tap facility" allowing mainly institutional investors to buy additional units on request. \par \par \uc2  The government on Wednesday invited investment banks to make proposals for another disposal, saying it would focus on share placement and exchangeable bonds. \par \par \uc2  About HK$48 billion of the portfolio will be retained as a long-term investment, it said. \par \par \uc2  Yam said on Thursday the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was "an unpleasant experience that I simply wish I could forget." \par \par \uc2  "I will probably have to carry it to my grave with mixed feelings. A firm believer in free markets being forced into market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  can find this sort of thing traumatic," he said. \par \par \uc2  "It felt like an old and trusted friend turning his back on you and failing you miserably when you needed him most. It felt like discovering your comfortable home being infested with termites," he added. \par \par \uc2  ((Hong Kong Newsroom +852 2843-6519, Fax +852 2845-0636 hongkong.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010822dw83012h9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
