\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dlr Steady Midday But Headed Weaker; Some US$ Buying \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juli 1999\par 05:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar is holding steady at HK$7.7588 early Monday, but appears to be heading lower because of buying interest in the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Forward premiums, meanwhile, have edged lower after spiking late Friday. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar is trading at HK$7.7588 per U.S. dollar at 0236 GMT (10:37 p.m. EDT), unchanged from late Friday. \par \par \uc2  "There are still some buyers of U.S. dollars in the market," said a dealer with a Hong Kong bank. That, he said, is keeping the market on course toward the HK$7.7590-95 level, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's HK$7.7596 \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level. \par \par \uc2  He added that, given the light volumes, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is apt to trade slightly weaker through the session as ample liquidity in the money market keeps down buying interest in the Hong Kong dollar. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong Association of Banks' decision Friday to keep commercial interest rates steady in the wake of a U.S. rate increase also backs that trend. \par \par \uc2  In the forward market, the one-year premium is trading at 850 points over the spot rate, down from a level nearer 870 late Friday. Rates began rising Friday after the HKMA predicted that HK$675 million will flow out of the banking system Tuesday due to the sale of Hong Kong dollars for U.S. dollars initiated Friday. \par \par \uc2  -By Dow Jones Newswires; (852)2802-7002 \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 05-07-99 \par \par \uc2  0346GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv75051ta\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
