\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Weaker Midday But Downside Seen Limited \b0\par\par\uc2 309 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juni 1999\par 05:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar is weaker midmorning Thursday as money-market liquidity returns to normal after days of tight trading, pushing local interest rates lower. \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is trading at HK$7.7582 per U.S. dollar at 0249 GMT (10:49 p.m. Wednesday EDT), after hitting HK$7.7579 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "Interest rates are down because (liquidity) has returned to normal and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has weakened off," said a dealer with a domestic bank. As part of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  injected funds into the money market, easing tight conditions that had favored the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will inject HK$2.25 billion into the banking system Thursday, due to the purchase of Hong Kong dollars for U.S. dollars initiated Tuesday under the territory's T+2 settlement system. \par \par \uc2  The volatile overnight interbank rate hit 6.25% in Wednesday trade, but has fallen back to 5.87% midday Thursday. \par \par \uc2  However, the trader said there is little scope for much further weakness in the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar as the spot rate approaches Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate of HK$7.7585. The HKMA is moving the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate by one "pip" per day until it reaches the official peg rate of HK$7.7800. \par \par \uc2  "So it looks like trade will remain pretty quiet through to the weekend," he said. \par \par \uc2  In the forward market, premiums continue to drop with the one-year premium down to 845 points over the spot rate midday, compared with 870 points in the previous session. A money-market trader said he expects the one-year forward to bottom out soon as the Hong Kong dollar weakens and dealers increase protective hedging activities. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0333GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6o04pc4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
