\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dlr Steady Late; Commercial Deals Only As Hibor Fall \b0\par\par\uc2 297 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juni 1999\par 10:29\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar is steady in late afternoon trading Thursday, holding close to weak midday levels in light commercial trading. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a U.K.-based bank said that after an initial weakening of the spot Hong Kong dollar rate to HK$7.7582 from HK$7.7579 late during the previous session, market activity has all but dried up. \par \par \uc2  Decent money market liquidity led to a drop in interbank interest rates, the dealer added. \par \par \uc2  He said the Hong Kong dollar has been holding to a tight HK$7.7580-82 range all afternoon, with a \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate of HK$7.7585 limiting moneymaking opportunities on one end. \par \par \uc2  At the other end, despite a fall in Hong Kong dollar interbank rates, the rates are still well above U.S. dollar rates, and strong support for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  kicks in at just below HK$7.7580, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  With the Hong Kong dollar stuck in a tight range, banks have merely been filling buy and sell orders for clients with commercial demand, brokers said. \par \par \uc2  Forward premiums have risen a bit intraday, but also in light activity, with several dealers saying the move was expected along with the slight weakening of the Hong Kong dollar. As the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakens, hedging activity tends to pick up. \par \par \uc2  The one-year premium is 880 points over the spot rate from 845 around midday, and could rise a touch more overnight in London and New York or early Friday if the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar moves any closer to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate. \par \par \uc2  -By Adam S. Najberg; (852)2802-7002; naj@asiaonline.net \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0829GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6o04qfq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
