\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Weaker Early On Concerns Of U.S. Rate Rise \b0\par\par\uc2 289 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juni 1999\par 04:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar is weaker early Monday and is flirting with the quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate on concerns of an imminent U.S. interest rate increase. \par \par \uc2  The local dollar was trading at HK$7.7572 at 0230 GMT (10:30 p.m. EDT, Sunday), weaker than late Friday's HK$7.7570 per U.S. dollar level. \par \par \uc2  The head of money markets at a U.S. bank said U.S. rate concerns are overhanging local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading so far Monday. With the yield of the U.S. long bond having climbed to over 6% Friday and with stock investors in Hong Kong displaying caution so far Monday, the Hong Kong dollar is seen holding close to or at the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's HK$7.7575 \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate for the rest of the Asian trading day. \par \par \uc2  Interbank interest rates have risen slightly, and recent U.S. dollar weakness against the yen are also fueling concerns about a forthcoming U.S. rate rise. \par \par \uc2  The Federal Reserve's Open Market Committee will meet at the end of the month to discuss interest rates. \par \par \uc2  But after an initial burst of activity that drove the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar close to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate, trading has quieted and transaction size has shrunk. \par \par \uc2  Rate-related concerns are also behind an early rise in forward premiums. The one-year premium is up to 1,080 points over the spot rate from 1,000 points late Friday. The six-month premium is 325 points, up from 300 points. \par \par \uc2  -By Adam Najberg; (852)2802-7002; \par \par \uc2  adam.najberg@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 14-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0255GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6e04hvk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
