\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Dn Midday, Fwd Premiums Up On Argentina Worries \b0\par\par\uc2 287 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Mai 1999\par 06:19\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--Continued rumors that Argentina will abandon its eight-year-old \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board are overhanging the Hong Kong dollar market Monday, moving the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  a touch weaker and forward premiums higher. \par \par \uc2  Despite a statement from the Argentine government last week firmly backing its one-for-one peg, investors in Hong Kong remain unconvinced and are worried Hong Kong's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board will come under pressure if Argentina drops its linked system. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar is being mildly hurt by the continued rumors. It's quoted at HK$7.7543 per US$1.00 at 0405 GMT (12:05 a.m. EDT), compared with HK$7.7538 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  Activity is light, with the average transaction size well under US$100 million. There's little chance the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will move weaker to test the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's HK$7.7554 \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate. \par \par \uc2  Forward activity is much heavier, said a dealer at a U.S. bank. Hedge funds are believed to be spreading the rumors, or at least, believing them, and are rolling over their positions. That's an indication of a negative outlook toward the Hong Kong dollar. \par \par \uc2  Other investors - seeing or hearing what the hedge funds are doing - are nervously hedging Hong Kong dollar exposure in the forward markets. \par \par \uc2  The six-month premium is up to 325 points from 285 points over the spot rate late Friday. The one-year premium has jumped to 1080 points from 980 points. Premiums are expected to climb further over the rest of the day, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  -By Adam Najberg; (852)2802-7002; naj@asiaonline.net \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-05-99 \par \par \uc2  0419GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv5o03xcb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
