\par\par \b \uc2  HK's Fincl Secretary Says HK Dlr Peg To U.S. Dlr Must Remain \b0\par\par\uc2 241 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Mai 1999\par 03:52\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--Financial Secretary Donald Tsang said the Hong Kong dollar peg to the U.S. dollar must remain and defended the government's HK$118.1 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg. \par \par \uc2  "Our necessary but successful adherence to the link during difficult times has proved the confidence and resilience of the Hong Kong people," Tsang said in a speech in Denmark on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Tsang said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the territory's stock and futures markets last August doesn't mean the government isn't committed to free markets. \par \par \uc2  "Our commitment to free markets should not be judged on a single, extraordinary event during an exceptional and destabilizing attack on our \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and stock markets," he said. \par \par \uc2  Tsang said there was clear evidence in an "unprecedented volatile external environment" of speculators "deploying a double-play strategy." \par \par \uc2  "There were strong signs that the markets were beginning to fail, and local confidence was in jeopardy," Tsang said. \par \par \uc2  That was why the government decided to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the stock and futures market to squeeze out speculators attacking the Hong Kong dollar, Tsang said. \par \par \uc2  He said the government has set up Exchange Fund Investment Ltd. to manage the portfolio it acquired when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, and appointed three independent advisers to assist it. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 05-05-99 \par \par \uc2  0152GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv5503gco\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
